flowchart LR
  BRIEF[Brief and selected skills] --> READ[Bounded overview and relevant queries]
  READ --> PLAN[Plan and quality criteria]
  PLAN --> PATCH[Revision-checked draft patch]
  PATCH --> VALIDATE[Validate and reserve budget]
  VALIDATE --> RUN[Run affected nodes]
  RUN --> EVIDENCE[Inspect selected evidence]
  EVIDENCE --> DECIDE{Checks and allowance}
  DECIDE -->|Criteria satisfied| ACCEPT[Accepted checkpoint]
  DECIDE -->|Revise, budget remains| PATCH
  DECIDE -->|Budget, no progress, interruption| STOP[Recorded stop or human review]
  RUN -.-> HISTORY[(Immutable run and skill versions)]
  EVIDENCE -.-> HISTORY
